<title>UK: Oppland Energiverke sets 150 mln SFR May 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Oppland Energiverke sets 150 mln SFR May 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OPPLAND ENERGIVERKE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  COUNTY OF OPPLAND</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50 PCT  MATURITY    27.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102	 PAY DATE   L10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
